{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>曾參與《魔音女團》兼年僅21歲新晉小花周智敏早前飛赴德國度假，罕有地在社交平台大派福利，展現與平日截然不同火辣一面。她無預警換上極少布水着大騷傲人身材，成功將大眾視線由其歌唱實力轉移至出眾外在條件。這位被視為黑馬女新人背後其實隱藏住一個顛覆大眾認知破格決定。</p>\n<h2>周智敏慕尼黑海德堡之旅罕現惹火水着</h2>\n<p>周智敏前往德國慕尼黑以及海德堡等地放假充電，期間更連環釋出多張極具夏日氣息旅遊照片。染有一頭搶眼紅髮周智敏突然大解放，換上一套深色幼帶比堅尼，毫無保留地展現豐滿上圍及火辣線條。除了超吸睛水着照之外，她亦有穿上格仔連身裙於公園長椅打卡，甚至拿起巨型蝴蝶餅遮面扮可愛，以及趴在草坡上欣賞夕陽美景。</p>\n<h2>社交平台狂派福利展現最真實自我面貌</h2>\n<p>面對外界對於其罕有性感造型高度關注，周智敏選擇透過社交平台繼續與網民及粉絲進行互動。她主動將這批充滿生活感旅遊日常照片上載至網絡，大方與大眾分享身處異國放假心情。她透過連串生活動態更新，向外界展露脫下華麗舞台服飾後，私下穿著休閒服裝及素顏打卡等真實狀態。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179481642888379422_1835032746afab9ade9150.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"周智敏 魔音女團 （圖片來源：IG@emchow816）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179481642888379422_1835032746afab9ade9150.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948164341199644_13913600366afab9b292b6f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"周智敏 魔音女團 罕現惹火水着（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948164341199644_13913600366afab9b292b6f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>罕現惹火水着（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>放棄澳洲學位為追夢參加《聲秀》</h2>\n<p>其實周智敏從小視梅艷芳為偶像，更一直積極學習跳舞同埋彈結他。她在英國中學畢業後，為了留港追逐演藝夢想，毅然放棄澳洲大學學位，選擇入讀浸會大學流行音樂系。她早於2024年奪得《歌手的誕生大賽》季軍，去年參與《聲秀》時憑實力殺入總決賽並取得第6名，今年再接再厲出戰《魔音女團》，雖然最終落敗卻依然在網上獲得極高關注度。</p>\n<h2>大批網民湧入留言激讚外在條件超屈機</h2>\n<p>這輯德國旅行靚相一經曝光，隨即在社交媒體掀起極大迴響，大批粉絲及網民紛紛湧入其社交帳號留言。不少人對其深藏不露好身材感到驚訝，有網民直接留言大讚「身材太好了吧」，亦有人表示「歐遊好靚好Chill」。大眾焦點同時落在她兼備外貌與音樂底子之上，更有網民激動直指她「又有才華身材又正，簡直係女神」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179481643744063695_6611382306afab9b5cee51.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"周智敏 魔音女團 （圖片來源：IG@emchow816）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179481643744063695_6611382306afab9b5cee51.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179481644137584203_7983935736afab9b9d8454.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"周智敏 魔音女團 （圖片來源：IG@emchow816）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179481644137584203_7983935736afab9b9d8454.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179481644540480474_19633213326afab9bdeabdc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"周智敏 魔音女團 有份參加台慶Opening 隧道Mass Dance（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179481644540480474_19633213326afab9bdeabdc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>有份參加台慶Opening 隧道Mass Dance（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179481644711129592_10669746886afab9bf71c72.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"周智敏 魔音女團 （圖片來源：IG@emchow816）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179481644711129592_10669746886afab9bf71c72.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948164491343144_11215460146afab9c1a9e9b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"周智敏 魔音女團 （圖片來源：IG@emchow816）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948164491343144_11215460146afab9c1a9e9b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179481645056394414_21207662936afab9c35ed18.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"周智敏 魔音女團 （圖片來源：IG@emchow816）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179481645056394414_21207662936afab9c35ed18.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/176059125827749887_176841745868f07d9a96f9c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"周智敏 魔音女團 係《聲秀》嘅參賽者，最終攞到第六名。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/176059125827749887_176841745868f07d9a96f9c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>係《聲秀》嘅參賽者，最終攞到第六名。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/176128946356528070_17242440768fb24f7c5c7b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"周智敏 魔音女團 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/176128946356528070_17242440768fb24f7c5c7b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/582914575_17909002329259339_4335939420895462175_n_1828596272691fdc512bf3e-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"周智敏 魔音女團 （圖片來源：周智敏IG）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/582914575_17909002329259339_4335939420895462175_n_1828596272691fdc512bf3e-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：周智敏IG）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T03:43:51.132277+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1238,"images":11,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T03:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T04:57:23.112547+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T03:37:23.620814+00:00","content_hash":"16408596147ffb86ce4ca95130c8990985ed349cba647fefbe1757e0a8152dec","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}